## Hints

- E1: crossing-time median ≈ (2/SR)² in years — log-scale the check.
- E4: SR_annual = t/√Y (Y in years — the daily/monthly frequency
  doesn't enter). (a) 2.8/√8 ≈ 0.99; (b) 4.1/√2 ≈ 2.9; (c) 2.1/√30 ≈
  0.38. Watch the frequency trap: dividing by √(n_periods) gives the
  PER-PERIOD Sharpe — annualize it back with √(periods/year) and you
  recover the same t/√Y. Do it both ways as a check.
